## Quick reminders

- Nix + `uv` (per app); no durable `pip install`.
- Apps in `/apps/<name>`; shared in `/modules`.
- Process: Spec Kit (`/speckit-*`) + lab overlays (review, falsifiability, acceptance catalog).
